{"id":"capacite_","lemma":"capacité","pos":"noun","rank":2511,"glosses":["skill (capacity to do something well)","capacity (measure of the ability to hold, receive or absorb; maximum amount that can be contained)"],"ipa":"/ka.pa.si.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Fr-capacit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-capacit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"capacités"},"formAudio":{"capacités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-capacit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a confiance en ses capacités.","en":"He has confidence in his ability.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"confidence"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"J'ai confiance dans ses capacités.","en":"I have confidence in his abilities.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"confidence"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Sa capacité le qualifie pour le poste.","en":"His skill qualifies him for the job.","words":[{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to qualify","l":"qualifier"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"job, post"}]},{"text":"Tous ont différentes capacités.","en":"We all have different abilities.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"},null]},{"text":"Tu as perdu la capacité de te concentrer.","en":"You've lost the ability to concentrate.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to concentrate"}]}]}